Date: Wed, 04 Nov 2026 06:56:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 108/121] llama : SiegeLadder P19 - candidates carried as block
 indices (L020: the f32 mask rebuilt in the receiving graph by the source's
 own ops, a computed -inf template; equal byte for byte at 48K, exact and
 default), LLAMA_DSV4_LAYER_MAJOR_COST=1 per-graph cost split (L021),
 LLAMA_DSV4_LAYER_MAJOR_RESERVE=1 load-time probe of every k-layer segment
 graph's CUDA0 need at the worst case and of each MoE layer's expert bytes
 (L024); all off by default (SiegeLadder runs.md 4.285-4.287)

